# HotelEase – Hotel Booking Website

## About the Project
HotelEase is a frontend hotel booking website developed as a web development project. It provides a user-friendly interface for exploring hotel rooms and managing bookings.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## Project Pages
- Home Page
- Rooms Page
- Booking Page
- My Bookings Page
- Contact Page
- Login/Sign-up Page

## Purpose
The purpose of this project was to gain practical experience in frontend web development and build a functional hotel booking website.

## Developer
BS Software Engineering Student | Frontend Web Developer
